# Kuiz question bank: one critical-thinking question per falsafah.
# Each entry: id -> (question stem, [distractor ids]).
# The answer is always the ayat of falsafah `id`. Distractors are ayat with a
# similar theme but a different point. Run `python3 quiz_bank.py` to validate
# and write quiz.json (inlined by build.py).
